<section class="page" data-view="packages"><div class="page-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">ACCOUNT POLICY</span><h2>Hosting Packages</h2><p>Reusable account limits with live reconciliation, comparison, cloning and assignment visibility.</p></div></div><div class="split-page"><form class="panel-card quick-form" id="packageForm"><h3>Create / update package</h3><label>Name<input name="name" required placeholder="Business"></label><div class="form-grid"><label>Disk GB<input name="disk_gb" type="number" min="1" value="25"></label><label>Bandwidth GB<input name="bandwidth_gb" type="number" min="1" value="250"></label><label>Websites<input name="sites" type="number" min="1" value="10"></label><label>Domains<input name="domains" type="number" min="0" value="10"></label><label>Subdomains<input name="subdomains" type="number" min="0" value="50"></label><label>Alias domains<input name="alias_domains" type="number" min="0" value="10"></label><label>Databases<input name="databases" type="number" min="0" value="20"></label><label>Database users<input name="database_users" type="number" min="0" value="20"></label><label>Mailboxes<input name="mailboxes" type="number" min="0" value="50"></label><label>FTP/SFTP accounts<input name="ftp_accounts" type="number" min="0" value="10"></label><label>CPU %<input name="cpu_percent" type="number" min="25" max="800" value="200"></label><label>RAM MB<input name="ram_mb" type="number" min="128" value="2048"></label><label>I/O weight<input name="io_weight" type="number" min="1" max="10000" value="200"></label><label>Processes / PIDs<input name="pids" type="number" min="32" value="256"></label><label>Inodes<input name="inodes" type="number" min="1000" value="500000"></label><label>PHP memory MB<input name="php_memory_mb" type="number" min="64" value="512"></label><label>PHP workers<input name="php_workers" type="number" min="1" value="25"></label><label>Cron jobs<input name="cron_jobs" type="number" min="0" value="100"></label><label>Backup retention days<input name="backup_retention" type="number" min="1" value="14"></label></div><label>Feature list<select name="feature_list" id="packageFeatureList"></select></label><button class="primary">Save package</button></form><article class="panel-card"><h3>Packages</h3><div id="packagesTable" class="data-table"><div class="empty">Loading…</div></div></article></div></section>
<section class="page" data-view="features"><div class="page-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">ACCOUNT POLICY</span><h2>Feature Manager</h2><p>Server-enforced PPanel capabilities assignable to hosting packages.</p></div></div><div class="split-page"><form class="panel-card quick-form" id="featureForm"><h3>Create / update feature list</h3><label>Name<input name="name" required placeholder="Web Only"></label><div class="feature-check-grid"><label class="check-line"><input type="checkbox" name="features" value="files"> File Manager</label><label class="check-line"><input type="checkbox" name="features" value="ftp"> FTP</label><label class="check-line"><input type="checkbox" name="features" value="sftp"> SFTP</label><label class="check-line"><input type="checkbox" name="features" value="ssh"> SSH</label><label class="check-line"><input type="checkbox" name="features" value="domains"> Domains</label><label class="check-line"><input type="checkbox" name="features" value="subdomains"> Subdomains</label><label class="check-line"><input type="checkbox" name="features" value="dns"> DNS</label><label class="check-line"><input type="checkbox" name="features" value="email"> Email</label><label class="check-line"><input type="checkbox" name="features" value="webmail"> Webmail</label><label class="check-line"><input type="checkbox" name="features" value="databases"> Databases</label><label class="check-line"><input type="checkbox" name="features" value="phpmyadmin"> phpMyAdmin</label><label class="check-line"><input type="checkbox" name="features" value="php"> PHP Manager</label><label class="check-line"><input type="checkbox" name="features" value="ssl"> SSL</label><label class="check-line"><input type="checkbox" name="features" value="backups"> Backups</label><label class="check-line"><input type="checkbox" name="features" value="cron"> Cron</label><label class="check-line"><input type="checkbox" name="features" value="git"> Git</label><label class="check-line"><input type="checkbox" name="features" value="metrics"> Metrics</label><label class="check-line"><input type="checkbox" name="features" value="applications"> Applications</label><label class="check-line"><input type="checkbox" name="features" value="security"> Security</label><label class="check-line"><input type="checkbox" name="features" value="logs"> Logs</label><label class="check-line"><input type="checkbox" name="features" value="api"> API</label><label class="check-line"><input type="checkbox" name="features" value="developer_tools"> Developer tools</label></div><button class="primary">Save feature list</button></form><article class="panel-card"><h3>Feature lists</h3><div id="featureListsTable" class="data-table"><div class="empty">Loading…</div></div></article></div></section>
<section class="page" data-view="websites"><div class="page-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">HOSTING</span><h2>Websites</h2><p>Live websites and subdomains discovered from the effective Nginx configuration, including imported and manually configured vhosts.</p></div><div class="page-head-actions"><button class="ghost" data-modal="subdomain">Add subdomain</button><button class="primary" data-modal="site">Add website</button></div></div><article class="panel-card" id="inventoryDiagnostics"><div class="card-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">LIVE HOST DISCOVERY</span><h3>Authoritative server inventory</h3></div><span id="inventorySourceBadge" class="status-pill">Checking</span></div><p id="inventoryDiscoverySummary" class="muted">Scanning the effective Nginx configuration and hosting resources…</p><div id="inventoryWarnings" class="muted"></div></article><div id="sitesGrid" class="site-list"></div><article class="panel-card v7-workbench"><div class="card-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">ADVANCED WEBSITE POLICY</span><h3>HTTPS, HSTS, redirects & hotlink protection</h3></div><span class="status-pill active">VALIDATED NGINX</span></div><form id="sitePolicyForm" class="quick-form"><label>Website<select name="domain" id="sitePolicyDomain" data-domain-source="existing-active" required></select></label><div class="form-grid"><label class="check-line"><input type="checkbox" name="force_https"> Force HTTPS</label><label class="check-line"><input type="checkbox" name="hsts"> HSTS</label><label class="check-line"><input type="checkbox" name="hotlink_protection"> Hotlink protection</label><label>HSTS max age<input type="number" name="hsts_max_age" min="0" max="63072000" value="15552000"></label></div><label>Redirect entire site to<input name="redirect_target" type="url" placeholder="https://www.example.com (optional)"></label><label>Directory index<input name="directory_index" value="index.php index.html index.htm"></label><button class="primary" type="submit">Validate & apply website policy</button><small>Privora snapshots the vhost, runs nginx -t, reloads only on success and rolls back failed changes.</small></form><div id="sitePoliciesTable" class="data-table"><div class="empty">Loading website policies…</div></div></article></section>
<section class="page" data-view="resellers"><div class="page-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">ACCOUNT DELEGATION</span><h2>Reseller Center</h2><p>Create delegated hosting operators with explicit account, storage, package, feature, DNS and SSL limits. Reseller access stays scoped by RBAC and ownership.</p></div><span class="status-pill active">POLICY ENFORCED</span></div><div class="split-page"><form class="panel-card quick-form" id="resellerForm"><h3>Create / update reseller</h3><div class="form-grid"><label>Reseller ID<input name="name" required pattern="[a-z][a-z0-9_-]{2,63}" placeholder="partner1"></label><label>Company<input name="company" required maxlength="120" placeholder="Partner Hosting"></label><label>Maximum accounts<input name="max_accounts" type="number" min="1" value="25" required></label><label>Disk allocation (GB)<input name="disk_gb" type="number" min="0" value="250"></label><label>Bandwidth allocation (GB)<input name="bandwidth_gb" type="number" min="0" value="2500"></label><label>Status<select name="status"><option value="active">Active</option><option value="suspended">Suspended</option></select></label></div><label>Allowed packages<select name="allowed_packages" id="resellerPackages" multiple size="5"></select><small>Leave all unselected to allow any package.</small></label><label>Allowed feature lists<select name="allowed_feature_lists" id="resellerFeatures" multiple size="5"></select><small>Leave all unselected to allow any feature list.</small></label><div class="check-grid compact"><label class="check-line"><input type="checkbox" name="dns_allowed" checked> Allow DNS management</label><label class="check-line"><input type="checkbox" name="ssl_allowed" checked> Allow SSL management</label></div><label>Allowed nameserver bases<input name="nameserver_bases_text" placeholder="ns-host.example.com, partner.example.com"></label><button class="primary" type="submit">Save reseller policy</button></form><article class="panel-card"><div class="card-head"><div><h3>Resellers</h3><small>Delegated account ownership and limits</small></div></div><div id="resellersTable" class="data-table"><div class="empty">Loading resellers…</div></div></article></div></section>
<section class="page" data-view="files"><div class="page-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">ACCOUNT FILES</span><h2>File Management</h2><p>Inspect and edit account-rooted files through Privora's symlink-safe host adapter. Text writes are limited to 4 MiB and never escape the selected hosting account.</p></div><span class="badge online">LIVE ACCOUNT-SCOPED</span></div><div class="split-page"><form class="panel-card quick-form" id="fileWriteForm"><h3>Create / replace text file</h3><label>Account<select name="user" id="fileAccount"></select></label><label>Relative path<input name="path" required value="notes/hello.txt"></label><label>Content<textarea name="content" rows="6" placeholder="File contents"></textarea></label><button class="primary">Write file</button></form><article class="panel-card"><div class="card-head"><h3>Account files</h3><button class="ghost" id="refreshFiles">Refresh</button></div><div id="filesTable" class="data-table"></div></article></div></section>
<section class="page" data-view="sftp"><div class="page-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">0.10 SFTP</span><h2>SFTP accounts</h2><p>Jailed account definitions with SSH-key-first authentication policy.</p></div></div><div class="split-page"><form class="panel-card quick-form" data-create="sftp-create"><h3>Create SFTP account</h3><label>Username<input name="username" required placeholder="deploy1"></label><label>Owner<input name="owner" required value="acmeweb"></label><label>Root<input name="root" required value="/home/acmeweb"></label><label>Auth<select name="auth"><option value="ssh-key">SSH key</option><option value="password">Password</option></select></label><button class="primary">Create</button></form><article class="panel-card"><div id="sftpTable" class="data-table"></div></article></div></section>
<section class="page" data-view="apps"><div class="page-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">APPLICATIONS</span><h2>Application Lifecycle Center</h2><p>Discover live WordPress, Laravel, Node.js and Python applications and run only certified, allow-listed maintenance actions as the owning hosting account.</p></div><span class="badge online">LIVE DISCOVERY + SAFE ACTIONS</span></div><article class="panel-card v7-workbench"><div class="card-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">APPLICATION LIFECYCLE</span><h3>Detected hosted applications</h3></div><button class="ghost" id="refreshAppLifecycle" type="button">Rescan</button></div><p class="muted">Mutating WordPress/Laravel actions take a verified local pre-change backup first. Arbitrary root shell commands are never exposed.</p><div id="appLifecycleTable" class="data-table"><div class="empty">Scanning hosted applications…</div></div><pre id="appLifecycleOutput" class="operation-output" hidden></pre></article></section>
<section class="page" data-view="php"><div class="page-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">WEB STACK</span><h2>MultiPHP / PHP-FPM Manager</h2><p>Inventory installed PHP runtimes, FPM services, sockets and extensions, then assign a certified active runtime per website.</p></div><span class="badge online">LIVE RUNTIME INVENTORY</span></div><article class="panel-card"><h3>Installed runtimes</h3><div id="phpRuntimeTable" class="data-table"><div class="empty">Detecting PHP runtimes…</div></div></article><article class="panel-card"><h3>Per-site PHP</h3><div id="phpSites" class="data-table"></div></article></section>

<section class="page" data-view="databases"><div class="page-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">DATA</span><h2>Databases</h2><p>Create and manage database users, passwords and destructive lifecycle actions for certified MySQL, MariaDB and PostgreSQL engines.</p></div><span class="badge online">LIVE HOST</span></div><div class="split-page"><form class="panel-card quick-form" data-create="database-create"><h3>Create database</h3><label>Database name<input name="name" required placeholder="acme_app"></label><label>Owner<select name="owner" id="adminDatabaseOwner" required><option value="" disabled selected>Choose hosting account</option></select><small>Select the existing hosting account that will own this database.</small></label><label>Database user<input name="user" required placeholder="acme_app_user"><small>This is the username used to sign in to phpMyAdmin.</small></label><label>Password<input name="password" type="password" minlength="12" maxlength="128" autocomplete="new-password" placeholder="Leave blank to generate"><small>Leave blank and Privora will generate a strong one-time password.</small></label><label>Confirm password<input name="password_confirm" type="password" minlength="12" maxlength="128" autocomplete="new-password" placeholder="Only required when setting your own"></label><button type="button" class="ghost" data-db-generate="admin-create">Generate password</button><label>Engine<select name="engine" id="adminDatabaseEngine"><option value="mysql">MySQL</option><option value="mariadb">MariaDB</option><option value="postgresql">PostgreSQL</option></select><small id="adminDatabaseEngineHint">Detecting certified engines on this VPS…</small></label><button class="primary">Create database + user</button></form><article class="panel-card"><div class="capability-banner" id="phpMyAdminStatus">phpMyAdmin: detecting…</div><div id="databasesTable" class="data-table"></div></article></div><article class="panel-card wide"><div class="card-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">DATABASE HEALTH</span><h3>Inspection &amp; maintenance results</h3></div></div><div id="databaseOpsResults" class="data-table"><div class="empty">Choose Inspect, Check, Optimize, Export or Import beside a managed database.</div></div></article><article class="panel-card installer-credentials" id="databaseCredentials" hidden><div class="card-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">SAVE NOW</span><h3>Database credentials</h3></div><span class="badge warning">SHOWN ONCE</span></div><pre id="databaseCredentialsText"></pre><button type="button" class="ghost" data-copy-db-credentials="databaseCredentialsText">Copy credentials</button><p class="form-note">Privora does not store the plaintext password. Use Set / reset password if you lose it.</p></article><article class="panel-card v7-workbench"><div class="card-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">LIVE DATABASE ACTIVITY</span><h3>Running sessions & queries</h3></div><div class="inline-actions"><select id="databaseActivityEngine"><option value="mariadb">MariaDB</option><option value="mysql">MySQL</option><option value="postgresql">PostgreSQL</option></select><button class="ghost" id="refreshDatabaseActivity" type="button">Refresh</button></div></div><div id="databaseActivityTable" class="data-table"><div class="empty">Loading database activity…</div></div></article></section>
<section class="page" data-view="dns"><div class="page-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">DNS</span><h2>DNS Zone Manager</h2><p>View the live BIND zones on this server, create zones, and add, update, or delete individual records.</p></div><div class="page-actions"><button class="ghost" id="repairHostedDNS">Repair hosted DNS</button><button class="ghost" id="refreshDNS">Refresh DNS</button></div></div><div class="split-page"><form class="panel-card quick-form" data-create="dns-create"><h3>Create zone</h3><label>Domain<select name="domain" id="adminDNSDomain" data-domain-source="zone-available" required></select><small>Only domains already created in Privora are offered. Domains with an existing DNS zone are disabled.</small></label><label class="check-line"><input type="checkbox" name="dnssec" value="1"> Enable DNSSEC intent</label><p class="muted">New zones receive Privora's standard web/mail record set when a public server address is available.</p><button class="primary">Create zone</button></form><article class="panel-card"><h3>Authoritative zones</h3><div id="dnsTable" class="data-table"></div></article></div><article class="panel-card" id="dnsRepairResultsCard" hidden><div class="page-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">DNS REPAIR</span><h3>Hosted DNS repair results</h3><p class="muted">Privora shows the exact per-domain provisioning result so a failed root zone cannot be hidden behind a generic status.</p></div></div><div id="dnsRepairResults" class="data-table"></div></article><article class="panel-card" id="dnsEditorCard"><div class="page-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">ZONE EDITOR</span><h3 id="dnsEditorTitle">Select a zone</h3><p id="dnsEditorPath" class="muted">Choose Manage beside a Privora-managed zone.</p></div><button class="danger" type="button" id="deleteDNSZone" disabled>Delete zone</button></div><form class="quick-form" id="dnsRecordForm"><input type="hidden" name="domain" id="dnsRecordDomain"><div class="form-grid"><label>Type<select name="type" required><option>A</option><option>AAAA</option><option>CNAME</option><option>MX</option><option>TXT</option><option>CAA</option><option>NS</option></select></label><label>Name<input name="name" value="@" required placeholder="@ or host"></label><label>Value<input name="value" required placeholder="Record value"></label><label>TTL<input name="ttl" type="number" min="60" max="86400" value="3600" required></label></div><button class="primary" type="submit" id="dnsRecordSubmit">Add record</button><button class="ghost" type="button" id="dnsRecordCancel" hidden>Cancel edit</button></form><div id="dnsRecordsTable" class="data-table"><div class="empty">No zone selected.</div></div><p class="muted">The zone SOA and root authority are validated by Privora. Use Nameserver Manager to change the authoritative root NS pair.</p></article><div class="split-page v7-workbench"><article class="panel-card"><div class="card-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">DNSSEC</span><h3>Zone signing & DS records</h3></div><span id="dnssecBadge" class="status-pill">SELECT ZONE</span></div><p id="dnssecDetail" class="muted">Open a managed zone, then inspect or change DNSSEC.</p><div class="inline-actions"><button type="button" class="primary" id="enableDNSSEC" disabled>Enable DNSSEC</button><button type="button" class="danger" id="disableDNSSEC" disabled>Disable DNSSEC</button></div><pre id="dnssecDS" class="operation-output" hidden></pre></article><article class="panel-card"><div class="card-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">DNS TEMPLATES</span><h3>Reusable record sets</h3></div></div><form id="dnsTemplateForm" class="quick-form"><input type="hidden" name="id"><label>Template name<input name="name" required placeholder="Standard SaaS records"></label><label>Records (one per line)<textarea name="records_text" rows="6" placeholder="A @ 203.0.113.10 3600
TXT @ v=spf1 -all 3600"></textarea></label><button class="primary" type="submit">Save template</button></form><div id="dnsTemplatesTable" class="data-table"><div class="empty">Loading templates…</div></div></article></div></section>
<section class="page" data-view="nameservers"><div class="page-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">AUTHORITATIVE DNS</span><h2>Nameserver Manager</h2><p>Configure branded nameserver sets, then explicitly assign each hosted root domain to the set it should publish. Domains without an assignment use the default set.</p></div><button class="ghost" id="refreshNameservers">Refresh</button></div><div class="split-page"><div><form class="panel-card quick-form" id="nameserverForm"><h3>Create or update a nameserver set</h3><label>Nameserver base domain<select name="base_domain" data-domain-source="existing-root" required></select><small>This identifies the nameserver hostnames, not which customer zones must use them.</small></label><label>Primary nameserver<input name="primary" placeholder="ns1.hosting-example.com"></label><label>Secondary nameserver<input name="secondary" placeholder="ns2.hosting-example.com"></label><label>IPv4<input name="ipv4" id="nameserverIPv4" placeholder="Auto-detected"></label><label>IPv6<input name="ipv6" id="nameserverIPv6" placeholder="Optional / auto-detected"></label><label class="check-line"><input type="checkbox" name="default" value="1"> Make this the default set for unassigned zones</label><button class="primary" type="submit">Create / update nameserver set</button></form><form class="panel-card quick-form" id="nameserverAssignmentForm"><h3>Assign nameservers to a domain</h3><label>Hosted root domain<select name="domain" data-domain-source="existing-root" required></select></label><label>Nameserver set<select name="base_domain" id="nameserverAssignmentSet" required></select><small>Example: privoralabs.org can explicitly use ns1/ns2.privoralabs.com.</small></label><button class="primary" type="submit">Save assignment &amp; reconcile DNS</button></form></div><article class="panel-card"><h3>Configured nameserver sets</h3><div id="nameserverStatus" class="data-table"><div class="empty">Not configured.</div></div><h3>Domain assignments</h3><div id=